{
  "info": {
    "name": "Banco XYZ - Microservicios resilientes y seguros (OAuth2 + Kafka)",
    "description": "Coleccion para generar la evidencia de la Sumativa 3 - Semana 8 (Desarrollo Backend III).\n\nComponentes: Authorization Server OAuth 2.0, backend-core, 3 BFFs (web/mobile/atm), banco-batch, notificaciones-service (Kafka) y Resilience4j.\n\nIMPORTANTE: los BFFs y backend-core usan HTTPS con certificado autofirmado. En Postman desactiva la verificacion SSL:\n  Settings -> General -> 'SSL certificate verification' -> OFF\n\nFlujo OAuth 2.0 (client_credentials):\n  Cada BFF solicita su access token al Authorization Server (http://localhost:9000).\n  El token incluye el claim 'authorities' con el rol del canal (ROLE_WEB/ROLE_MOBILE/ROLE_ATM).\n\nClientes registrados:\n  Web    -> bff-web-client    / web-secret    -> ROLE_WEB\n  Mobile -> bff-mobile-client / mobile-secret -> ROLE_MOBILE\n  ATM    -> bff-atm-client    / atm-secret    -> ROLE_ATM\n\nOrden sugerido:\n  1) Folder '0 - Authorization Server' (evidencia OAuth2).\n  2) Folder '1 - Batch' -> 'Procesar datos' (carga los CSV en MySQL).\n  3) Folder '2 - Auth' -> ejecutar los 3 login (guardan los tokens automaticamente).\n  4) Ejecutar core, BFFs, notificaciones y la verificacion de seguridad.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "cuentaId", "value": "101" },
    { "key": "web_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "mobile_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "atm_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Authorization Server (OAuth2)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token ATM (client_credentials)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "bff-atm-client", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "atm-secret", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "atm", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:9000/oauth2/token",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "9000",
              "path": ["oauth2", "token"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('access_token emitido', () => pm.expect(b.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('scope atm', () => pm.expect(b.scope).to.eql('atm'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('atm_token', b.access_token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
